# ── External runtimes and datasets ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Only documentation and folder placeholders are versioned under external/.
# Everything a user can download or generate is NOT shipped:
#  - external/rmsx/: the RNAMotifScanX runtime (source, scoring matrices, query
#    models, scanner binaries) is downloaded on first run_from_scratch use from
#    https://cbb.ittc.ku.edu/RNAMotifScanX_Results/RSMViewer/rmsx.tar.gz
#    (see external/rmsx_setup.md). Only its README and bin/.gitkeep are tracked.
#  - external/rmsx_preannotated/rmsx_work_default/: one folder per PDB, downloaded
#    on first use. Only the 1s72 sample is tracked.
#  - external/fr3d/fr3d-python-latest/: the user's own FR3D checkout.
external/rmsx/*
!external/rmsx/README.md
!external/rmsx/bin/
external/rmsx/bin/*
!external/rmsx/bin/.gitkeep
external/rmsx_preannotated/*
!external/rmsx_preannotated/README.md
!external/rmsx_preannotated/rmsx_work_default/
external/rmsx_preannotated/rmsx_work_default/*
!external/rmsx_preannotated/rmsx_work_default/1s72/
!external/rmsx_preannotated/rmsx_work_default/1s72/**
external/fr3d/fr3d-python-latest/*
!external/fr3d/fr3d-python-latest/.gitkeep

# ── Python build artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.sqlite3
# macOS metadata
.DS_Store

# Local instructions; keep out of GitHub
GITHUB_UPLOAD_INSTRUCTIONS.txt
git upload.txt

# Local-only audit reports; keep out of GitHub
RMSX_AUDIT_REPORT.md

# ── Local dev/test harness, not shipped with the plugin ──────────────────────
/tests/

# ── Structures fetched locally during development/testing ───────────────────
/*.cif
/*.cif.gz
/cached_structures/*
!/cached_structures/.gitkeep

# ── Generated output (recreated by running the plugin; never shipped) ───────
/output/*
!/output/README.md
/motif_structures/

# ── Editor / build leftovers ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.swp
*~
*.o

# ── Local manuscript/benchmark work ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Figure S3 scripts and generated results are kept locally and are not part of
# the distributable plugin repository.
/figure s3/
/external/fr3d_local_from_csv/
/rsmviewer/database/user_annotations/fr3d/
/output/S3_4_*/
